.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt BMM150 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bmm150g
.Nd Bosch BMM150 geomagnetic sensor
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "bmm150g* at iic?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver attaches to a device-tree node compatible with
.Qq bosch,bmm150
and reports three magnetic-field axes through
.Xr sysmon_envsys 9 .
The sensor is configured for the Bosch regular preset at 10 Hz.
Axis values are integer nanotesla (nT), preserving the API's 1/16 microtesla
resolution because envsys has no magnetic-field unit.
.Pp
Factory trim compensation uses Bosch SensorAPI v2.0.0 from commit
.Lk https://github.com/boschsensortec/BMM150_SensorAPI/commit/0dce0617873cda1f6d51f6b7b961fdc2641e0c7c .
The prepared source package retains the Bosch copyright and BSD-3-Clause
license notices. Ports carries the NetBSD kernel-header and I2C transport-error
patches so all consumers use the same source revision and fixes.
.Sh DEVICE TREE
.Bl -tag -width "compatible"
.It compatible
.Qq bosch,bmm150
.It reg
I2C address.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr envstat 8 ,
.Xr sysmon_envsys 9
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in EmberBSD 11.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Bosch Sensortec
for the SensorAPI.
.An The EmberBSD Project
for the driver integration.
